graph TD
    subgraph Common["Common features (Mandatory baseline)"]
        direction TB
        subgraph CommonRow1[" "]
            direction LR
            Svc["{Service}<br/>(root of the family)"]
            DL["DomainLogic"]
            LOG["AppLogging"]
        end
        subgraph TC["TestConformance"]
            direction LR
            CUC["Cucumber Test"]
            COV["Code Coverage Test"]
            MUT["Mutation Test"]
            REP["Test Reports"]
        end
    end
    style CommonRow1 fill:none,stroke:none

    Common -->|Optional| In["Inbound"]
    Common -->|Optional| Metric
    Common -->|Optional| TaskBox
    Common -->|Optional| Storage
    Common -->|Optional| Out["Outbound"]

    Storage -->|"At least one (kind)"| Persistent
    Storage -->|"At least one (kind)"| Cache

    Persistent -->|"Alternative (realization)"| PostgreSQL
    Persistent -->|"Alternative (realization)"| SQLite

    Cache -->|"Alternative (realization)"| Redis
    Cache -->|"Alternative (realization)"| InMemory

    In -->|"At least one (kind)"| InboundSync
    In -->|"At least one (kind)"| InboundAsync

    InboundSync -->|"At least one (protocol)"| HttpApi
    InboundSync -->|"At least one (protocol)"| GrpcApi

    InboundAsync -->|Mandatory| MessageConsumer

    TaskBox -. "Requires" .-> Storage
    TaskBox -->|"At least one (criticality)"| NonCritical
    TaskBox -->|"At least one (criticality)"| Critical

    MessageConsumer -->|"At least one (protocol)"| KafkaConsumer
    MessageConsumer -->|"At least one (protocol)"| RabbitMQConsumer
    MessageConsumer -->|"Optional"| Inbox

    Inbox -. "Requires" .-> TaskBox

    Out -->|"At least one (kind)"| OutboundSync
    Out -->|"At least one (kind)"| Outbox

    OutboundSync -->|"At least one (protocol)"| HttpClient
    OutboundSync -->|"At least one (protocol)"| GrpcClient
    OutboundSync -->|"At least one (protocol)"| KafkaProducer
    OutboundSync -->|"At least one (protocol)"| RabbitMQProducer

    Outbox -. "Requires" .-> TaskBox
    Outbox -. "Requires" .-> OutboundSync

    Critical -. "Requires" .-> Persistent
    NonCritical -. "Requires (any of storage)" .-> Cache
    NonCritical -. "Requires (any of storage)" .-> Persistent
